    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to introduce No. 18 Swiftwood to the market. Situated within this secure, gated development in the heart of Saggart Village, this own-door, ground floor apartment extends to a generous 90sqm (approx.) and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. Bathed in natural light and presented with a warm, welcoming feel, this superb home is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers. \n\nAn entrance porch opens into an impressive open plan living, dining and kitchen area, where a striking bay window fills the space with natural light and creates an inviting setting for both everyday living and entertaining. An inner hallway gives access to two spacious double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom and hot press. French doors from the principal bedroom open directly onto a patio, providing a peaceful outdoor space to enjoy. \n\nThe location is exceptional, nestled in the vibrant village of Saggart at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains. Residents enjoy an excellent range of local amenities, including highly regarded schools, cafés, restaurants, welcoming pubs and the ever-popular Avoca café and food market, all within easy reach. Beautiful parks, scenic walking trails and a strong sense of community further enhance the area's appeal. Commuters are exceptionally well served, with the LUAS Red Line terminus just minutes away, while the N7, M50 and wider motorway network provide swift access to Dublin city centre and beyond."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrarance Hall - \n\n\nKitchen/ Living Room/ Dining Room - 6.88m x 5.74m\n\n\nRear Hall - 3.65m x 2.32m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.55m x 2.64m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 2.25m x 2.15m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.15m x 2.99m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.44m x 2.00m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Generous 2 bed/ 2 bath aprtment, offering 90sqm (approx.) accommodation</li><li> Impressive B BER rating, giving access to green mortgage rates</li><li> Secure, gated development</li><li> Large open plan kitchen / dining room / living</li><li> GFCH</li><li> 2 designated car parking spaces</li><li> Management fee 892.20 per annum (with a discount available if paid within 3 months of renewal)</li><li> Excellent transport links nearby - LUAS red line, multiple bus routes, M50 & N7</li><li> No onward chain</ul>"
      },
